o master in order to complete the levels. An<strong> addictive gameplay</strong> that will challenge your skill.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490030/extras/2653e783e4bf7d5ddad968cc83819a0b.poster.avif?t=1614625807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490030/extras/2653e783e4bf7d5ddad968cc83819a0b.webm?t=1614625807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490030/extras/2653e783e4bf7d5ddad968cc83819a0b.mp4?t=1614625807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Cyber dodge is highly based on skill and challenge. <strong>Will you be up to it ? How far will you be able to go ?</strong>",
